{"term": {"label": "心", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 30, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "不忍", "id": "不忍"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "力", "id": "力"}, {"form": "動", "id": "動"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "variants": [], "id": "心"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "惻", "id": "惻"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "羞", "id": "羞"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "辭", "id": "辭"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "隱", "id": "隱"}, {"form": "霸", "id": "霸"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.0228711901914416, "source": "惻", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 3.855452653939752, "source": "惻", "target": "隱"}, {"weight": 0.7419373447293773, "source": "惻", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "惻", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 1.7351891177396608, "source": "動", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.552867560945706, "source": "動", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.552867560945706, "source": "動", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.2460147415056513, "source": "動", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 3.449987545831587, "source": "力", "target": "霸"}, {"weight": 1.1474024528375417, "source": "力", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.3297240096314962, "source": "力", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 3.449987545831587, "source": "力", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 2.469158292819861, "source": "子", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.7568403652716422, "source": "子", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 0.